      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹4.47 (down from ₹5.74 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹5.96b (up 13% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹71.8m (down 22% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 1.2% (down from 1.7% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 34% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 12% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
